<p>&quot;Rumours have been circulating surround the events of Incident 5000-40-R-12&quot;</p>
<p>I think you mean either &quot;around&quot; or &quot;surrounding.&quot;</p>
<p>sorry if I'm being nitpicky, I'm sincerely trying to be helpful. I really love this piece. and omg, I want to understand more about where these creatures come from (the process was hinted at strongly enough that I think I get it, but I mean, like &#8212; how did this all start and why lol), why they're put together like this&#8230; what is C's endgame? what on earth is the deal?!?! so basically, you nailed the mystery theme, at least imo.</p>
